#NEXUS

[ ramírez-velasco2021a_fig19: Hadrosauroid time tree. Internal labels: the five ringed nodes (Hadrosauroidea, Hadrosauromorpha, Hadrosauridae, Saurolophidae, Saurolophinae) and the legend names of numbered boxes 3-6 and 8-11 (Claosauridae, Tsintaosaurini, Parasaurolophini, Lambeosaurini, Brachylophosaurini, Kritosaurini, Saurolophini, Edmontosaurini); boxes 1, 2 and 7 are 'Unamed clade' in the legend and are not encoded. 'Lambeosaurinae' is printed beside the Saurolophidae vertical, but the lambeosaurines join that vertical directly, so it is a polytomy, not a node. Transcribed by eye from full-resolution crops at 1-2x (the pixel listing failed on this figure's dotted leaders and markers). 92 tips, 9 polytomies (4, 5, 5, 9, 4, 4, 3, 4, 3 children); 13 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

